      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian carries a steaming cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念回到吧台后面，擦杯子。她的手在发抖——不是因为冷，是因为她想起来了：刚才端咖啡过去的时候，她的手指碰到了顾深的手指。\n她不记得什么时候开始，他的触碰会让她心"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "不对——她记得的。是第一次读心他的那天，看到雨中那个女孩的画面。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "看到过画面",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "key",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "但现在那段记忆正在变淡。她记得\"看到过画面\"，但画面的具体内容——女孩的脸、钥匙的颜色、雨的温度——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "模糊了。\n她需要再读一次。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
