  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "为什么要亲自来？让小李去谈就行了。但那家店……那个咖啡师……她看我的眼神不像其他人。其他人看我的职位、我的公司、我的表。她看的是——",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他用红笔在合同上画了一个圈，然后放下笔，揉了揉太阳穴。\n*\"为什么要亲自来？让小李去谈就行了。但那家店……那个咖啡师……她看我的眼神不像其他人。其他人看我的职位"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Mental",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the painting",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "画面碎了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sets the cup down on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念放下杯子，手在发抖。\n他不只是来收购的。\n她低头看自己的手——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "scar on skin",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "左手无名指的疤痕还在。但右手食指——那个她记得是高中时被美工刀划的痕迹——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian rinses the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "淡了。像一张被洗过的照片。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen turns and leaves",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "门口传来雨声。顾深已经走了。\n他的伞还靠在门边。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian runs out after someone",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念拿起那把伞，追出去——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the umbrella",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "巷子里空无一人。雨打在青石板上，溅起细密的水花。\n她站在雨里，手里握着他的伞。\n雨水顺着伞骨滴下来，打在她的手腕上——那道正在变淡的痕迹，被雨水冲得更模糊了。"
  }
]